{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_003","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"General Help Center experience","location_hint":"paragraph 15","char_start":349,"char_end":379,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_004","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Get started Popular articles Manage your developer account Create, upload, and publish Distribute your app Run tests and check performance Paid apps, in-app products & subscriptions Protect your app Comply with Google Play policies Fix an issue Android developer verification Central Play Help Center","location_hint":"paragraph 22","char_start":465,"char_end":765,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_005","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Restricted Content Intellectual Property Privacy, Deception and Device Abuse Use of SDKs In Apps Malware Impersonation Mobile Unwanted Software Monetization and Ads Store Listing and Promotion Spam, Functionality, and User Experience Other Programs Families Enforcement Updates and Other Resources How Google Play Works for Developers","location_hint":"paragraph 24","char_start":782,"char_end":1116,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_006","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"You can now request help from the Help page in your Play Console account. If you don't have access to Play Console, ask your account admin for an invite.","location_hint":"paragraph 26","char_start":1146,"char_end":1299,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_007","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"After you've created your Google Play developer account, you can create apps and set them up using Play Console.","location_hint":"paragraph 28","char_start":1347,"char_end":1459,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_008","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Select a default language and add the name of your app as you want it to appear on Google Play. You can change this later.","location_hint":"paragraph 32","char_start":1534,"char_end":1656,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_009","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Specify whether your application is an app or a game. You can change this later.","location_hint":"paragraph 33","char_start":1660,"char_end":1740,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_010","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Note: If your game is free, it will appear on both Google Play and Google Play Games on PC by default. If your game is paid, you must release it on Google Play Games on PC yourself.","location_hint":"paragraph 34","char_start":1744,"char_end":1925,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_011","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Specify whether your application is free or paid.","location_hint":"paragraph 35","char_start":1932,"char_end":1981,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_012","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Add an email address that Play Store users can use to contact you about this application.","location_hint":"paragraph 36","char_start":1985,"char_end":2074,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_013","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"In the \"Declarations\" section:","location_hint":"paragraph 37","char_start":2078,"char_end":2108,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_014","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Acknowledge the “Developer Program Policies” and “US export laws” declarations.","location_hint":"paragraph 38","char_start":2112,"char_end":2191,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_015","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Accept the Play App Signing Terms of Service .","location_hint":"paragraph 39","char_start":2195,"char_end":2241,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_016","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"After you create your app, you can start setting it up. Your app’s dashboard will guide you through all the most important steps to get your app available on Google Play.","location_hint":"paragraph 42","char_start":2288,"char_end":2458,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_017","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"You’ll start by providing details about your app’s content, and entering information for your Google Play store listing. After that, you can move onto app release; this guides you through pre-release management, testing, and promotion to build pre-release excitement and awareness. The final step is launching your app on Google Play, making it available to billions of users.","location_hint":"paragraph 43","char_start":2460,"char_end":2836,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_018","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Developers with personal accounts created after November 13, 2023, must meet specific testing requirements before they can make their app available on Google Play. Read this Help Center article to learn more.","location_hint":"paragraph 44","char_start":2838,"char_end":3046,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_019","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"To start setting up your app, select Dashboard on the left menu. For the next steps, go to Set up your app on the app dashboard .","location_hint":"paragraph 45","char_start":3048,"char_end":3177,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_020","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Manage your app and app bundles","location_hint":"paragraph 46","char_start":3179,"char_end":3210,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_021","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Google Play uses Android App Bundles to generate and deliver APKs that are optimized for each device configuration, providing users with more efficient apps. This means you only need to build, sign, and upload a single app bundle to support optimized APKs for a wide variety of device configurations. Google Play then manages and serves your app's distribution APKs for you.","location_hint":"paragraph 47","char_start":3212,"char_end":3586,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_022","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Package names for app files are unique and permanent, so please name them carefully. Package names can't be deleted or re-used in the future.","location_hint":"paragraph 48","char_start":3588,"char_end":3729,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_023","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Your release can have one of three statuses:","location_hint":"paragraph 49","char_start":3731,"char_end":3775,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_024","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Draft: APKs that have not been served to users yet","location_hint":"paragraph 50","char_start":3780,"char_end":3830,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_025","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Active: APKs currently being served to users","location_hint":"paragraph 51","char_start":3834,"char_end":3878,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_026","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Archived: APKs that were once active but are no longer being served to users","location_hint":"paragraph 52","char_start":3882,"char_end":3958,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_027","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"To see your app bundles and APKs:","location_hint":"paragraph 54","char_start":3984,"char_end":4017,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_028","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Open Play Console and go to the App bundle explorer page ( Test and release > App bundle explorer ).","location_hint":"paragraph 55","char_start":4022,"char_end":4122,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_029","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"The App bundle explorer page features a version filter on the top right of the page, which you can use in conjunction with the three tabs ( Details , Downloads , and Delivery ) to explore different versions and configurations of your app’s APKs on different devices.","location_hint":"paragraph 56","char_start":4126,"char_end":4392,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_030","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Note: This version filter is the functional equivalent of the “Artifact library” on the old version of Play Console.","location_hint":"paragraph 57","char_start":4399,"char_end":4515,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_031","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"To learn more about managing your artifacts, go to Inspect app versions with the app bundle explorer.","location_hint":"paragraph 58","char_start":4521,"char_end":4622,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_032","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Apps on Google Play have a size limit, which is based on the maximum compressed size of your APKs at the time of download across all supported devices.","location_hint":"paragraph 60","char_start":4646,"char_end":4797,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_033","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"After you upload an app bundle, Play Console uses gzip to estimate what your app’s download size will be. Google Play uses the best possible advanced compression tools meaning a user’s actual download size will often be smaller than the estimate you see in Play Console.","location_hint":"paragraph 61","char_start":4801,"char_end":5071,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_034","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"200MB: Maximum compressed download size of APKs for one device generated from app bundles. The app bundle itself can be many times larger than this size.","location_hint":"paragraph 63","char_start":5108,"char_end":5261,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_035","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"100MB : Maximum compressed download size of APK for apps published with APKs (only applicable to apps created before August 2021).","location_hint":"paragraph 64","char_start":5265,"char_end":5395,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_036","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Android requires that all apps be digitally signed with a certificate before they can be installed. For more information, go to the Android Developers site . When you create your first release you can configure Play App Signing to decide whether your app should use a Google-generated app signing key or an app signing key that you choose.","location_hint":"paragraph 66","char_start":5429,"char_end":5768,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_037","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"App version requirements for Play Console","location_hint":"paragraph 67","char_start":5770,"char_end":5811,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_038","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Every app bundle and APK has a versionCode in the manifest file that's incremented with each update of your app.","location_hint":"paragraph 68","char_start":5815,"char_end":5927,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_039","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"To upload your app to Play Console, the greatest possible value for versionCode is 2100000000. If the versionCode of your app exceeds this value, Play Console will prevent you from submitting a new app bundle.","location_hint":"paragraph 69","char_start":5931,"char_end":6140,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_040","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"When selecting the versionCode for your app bundle, keep in mind that you'll need to increase the versionCode for every update and still stay below the maximum.","location_hint":"paragraph 70","char_start":6144,"char_end":6304,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_041","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Note : For more information on versioning your app, go to the Android Developers site . Keep in mind the Android MAXINT differs from Play Console upload requirements.","location_hint":"paragraph 71","char_start":6308,"char_end":6474,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_042","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Meet target API level requirements","location_hint":"paragraph 72","char_start":6476,"char_end":6510,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_043","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"When you upload an app bundle, it needs to meet Google Play’s target API level requirements. Here are the levels that apps currently need to target and will need to target in the future.","location_hint":"paragraph 73","char_start":6514,"char_end":6700,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_044","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Refer to Target API level requirements for Google Play apps to understand the target API levels required to provide Android and Google Play users with a safe and secure experience.","location_hint":"paragraph 74","char_start":6704,"char_end":6884,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_045","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Set up your store listing and settings","location_hint":"paragraph 75","char_start":6886,"char_end":6924,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_046","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Your app's store listing is displayed on Google Play and includes details that help users learn more about your app. Your store listing is shared across tracks, including testing tracks .","location_hint":"paragraph 76","char_start":6926,"char_end":7113,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_047","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Open Play Console and go to the Main store listing page.","location_hint":"paragraph 78","char_start":7135,"char_end":7191,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_048","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Fill in the fields under \"App Details.\"","location_hint":"paragraph 79","char_start":7195,"char_end":7234,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_049","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Field\nDescription\nCharacter limit*\nNotes","location_hint":"paragraph 80","char_start":7245,"char_end":7285,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_050","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"App name\nYour app's name on Google Play.\n30 character limit","location_hint":"paragraph 81","char_start":7290,"char_end":7349,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_051","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"You can add one localized name per language.","location_hint":"paragraph 82","char_start":7353,"char_end":7397,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_052","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Short description\nThe first text users see when looking at your app's detail page on the Play Store app.\n80 character limit\nUsers can expand this text to view your app's full description.","location_hint":"paragraph 83","char_start":7404,"char_end":7591,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
