{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_055","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Note : Repetitive or irrelevant use of keywords in the app name, description, or promotional description can create an unpleasant user experience and result in an app being suspended on Google Play. Please refer to full guidelines in the Google Play Developer Program Policies .","location_hint":"paragraph 86","char_start":7858,"char_end":8136,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_056","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Learn more about adding preview assets (including a short description, screenshots, and videos) to showcase your app.","location_hint":"paragraph 88","char_start":8156,"char_end":8273,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_057","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Note: By making your app available on Google Play, you grant Google license to use your app's assets (including your app icon, screenshots, and videos) for promotional purposes You're enabling Google Play to showcase your app in the best possible light. We may use these assets to highlight your app on the Play Store, in promotional campaigns, and across other Google services. This helps us reach more users and highlight the unique features of your app. You can find more details about this in the Developer Distribution Agreement (6. Brand Features and Publicity).","location_hint":"paragraph 89","char_start":8277,"char_end":8845,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_058","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"When you upload an app, the default language is English (United States, en-US). You can add translations of your app's information, along with in-language screenshots and other graphic assets. Go to Translate and localize your app to learn how.","location_hint":"paragraph 92","char_start":8908,"char_end":9152,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_059","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"To market your app in different languages more effectively, you can add localized graphic assets to your app's Main store listing page.","location_hint":"paragraph 94","char_start":9187,"char_end":9322,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_060","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"Users will see the localized graphic assets on Google Play if their language preferences match the languages that you've added.","location_hint":"paragraph 95","char_start":9326,"char_end":9453,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5fda19aa5cd8_061","source_id":"src_5fda19aa5cd8","source_hash":"3ade208d48f7d8e75f67ec29e4e194e3c1a56765bf864599d3ae95449a07bd40","text":"If you don't add your own translations, users can view an automated translation of your app's Google Play store listing page using Google Translate or the default language for your app.","location_hint":"paragraph 97","char_start":9483,"char_end":9668,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T08:12:23.337Z"}
